    {
      "assumption": "Procedural fairness is more valuable to a stable society than the marginal performance gains of opaque models.",
      "if_wrong": "If accuracy were the sole metric of social value, my argument for mandated explainability would collapse in favor of prioritizing pure performance."
    },
    {
      "assumption": "Developers can and should be held legally liable for the logic embedded in their automated systems.",
